dScanner.network.toLino%28%29%29%20fail%28%27the%20selected%20scanner%20definition%20differs%20from%20its%20versioned%20implementation%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20scanner%20%3D%20modeStacks%20%3F%20inferGrammarScannerModeStack%28model.scannerModeStackObservations%2C%20undefined%2C%20classes%29%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3A%20%28classes%20%3F%20inferGrammarScannerClasses%20%3A%20inferGrammarScanner%29%28model.scannerObservations%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%20else%20if%20%28storedScanner%29%20fail%28%27the%20selected%20scanner%20definition%20needs%20its%20actual%20observations%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20definitions%20%3D%20select%28%27regular-discovery-algorithm%27%2C%20%27typed%20program%27%29%2C%20bundled%20%3D%20createRegularGrammarInferenceProgramLinks%28%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28%21definitions.root.equals%28bundled.root%29%20%7C%7C%20definitions.network.toLino%28%29%20%21%3D%3D%20bundled.network.toLino%28%29%29%20fail%28%27the%20selected%20algorithm%20definition%20differs%20from%20its%20versioned%20implementation%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20options%20%3D%20configuration%28model.options%29%2C%20input%20%3D%20samples%28model.positives%2C%20model.negatives%2C%20options%2C%20scanner%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20table%20%3D%20inferRegularGrammarTable%28input.encoded%2C%20input.alphabet.length%2C%20strategies.indexOf%28options.strategy%29%2C%20options.alpha%2C%0A%20%20%20%20options.stateLimit%2C%20options.pairLimit%2C%20options.attemptLimit%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28table%5B0%5D%20%3C%200%29%20fail%28readInferenceFailureReason%28table%5B0%5D%29%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28%21acceptInferenceTableShape%28table%2C%20input.alphabet.length%29%29%20fail%28%27invalid%20model%20table%27%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28%21isDeepStrictEqual%28input.alphabet%2C%20model.alphabet%29%20%7C%7C%20%21isDeepStrictEqual%28table%2C%20model.table%29%29%20fail%28%27model%20decisions%20do%20not%20follow%20the%20stored%20observations%20and%20algorithm%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20candidate%20%3D%20select%28%27regular-discovery-grammar%27%2C%20%27disco